OL,3,AAncient bridge hidden under reservoir
OL,4,Ais revealed
OL,5,
OL,6,FDr Lucy Shipley, historic environment
OL,7,Frecord officer for Exmoor, said: "We
OL,8,Flive in an ever-changing world and it's
OL,9,Fnot a kind of fixed point where things
OL,10,Fstay the same."
